              "asynchronous_ai_overview": false,
              "markdown": "![Hebrew Words • 7ESL](https://api.dataforseo.com/cdn/i/10131400-2762-0139-0000-15c4cb127a4c:4)\nBasic Hebrew words include essential everyday terms and common greetings used in the language.[[1]](https://www.teachmehebrew.com/500-basic-hebrew-words.html)[[2]](https://www.chabad.org/library/article_cdo/aid/4305107/jewish/13-Basic-Hebrew-Words-to-Know-and-Use-All-the-Time.htm)\n\n### Essential Everyday Words & Greetings\n\n- **Shalom** (שלום) — Peace, hello, or goodbye\n- **Todah** (תודה) — Thank you\n- **Ken / Lo** (כן / לא) — Yes / No\n- **Mayim** (מים) — Water\n- **Kafeh** (קפה) — Coffee\n- **Bayit** (בית) — House\n- **Kesef** (כסף) — Money\n- **Ahavah** (אהבה) — Love[[1]](https://jewishmiami.org/about/departments/missions/common_hebrew_words_and_phrases/)[[2]](https://www.chabad.org/library/article_cdo/aid/4305107/jewish/13-Basic-Hebrew-Words-to-Know-and-Use-All-the-Time.htm)[[3]](https://www.teachmehebrew.com/500-basic-hebrew-words.html)\n\n### Core Pronouns & Question Words\n\n- **Ani** (אני) — I\n- **Ata / At** (אתה / את) — You (masculine / feminine)\n- **Mah** (מה) — What\n- **Mi** (מי) — Who\n- **Eifoh** (איפה) — Where[[1]](https://www.hebrewpod101.com/blog/2021/09/23/hebrew-beginner-words/)[[2]](https://doitinhebrew.com/)\n\nYou can explore comprehensive lists and beginner guides through [Teach Me Hebrew](https://www.teachmehebrew.com/500-basic-hebrew-words.html) or review foundational vocabulary via [Chabad.org](https://www.chabad.org/library/article_cdo/aid/4305107/jewish/13-Basic-Hebrew-Words-to-Know-and-Use-All-the-Time.htm).[[1]](https://www.teachmehebrew.com/500-basic-hebrew-words.html)[[2]](https://www.chabad.org/library/article_cdo/aid/4305107/jewish/13-Basic-Hebrew-Words-to-Know-and-Use-All-the-Time.htm)Would you like to focus on **conversational Modern Hebrew phrases**, **Hebrew alphabet (Aleph-Bet) letters** , or **religious/biblical terms**?",
